    "title": "Scenario 1 - User Authentication System",
    "owner": "Asadullah",
    "description": "A small web application that allows registered users to log in using username and password. The application stores credentials in a relational database, uses session tokens for authenticated sessions, and communicates over HTTPS. No multi-factor authentication is implemented.",
    "id": 0
  },
